# Leave DATABASE_URL unset for local development — the app falls back to an
# embedded PGlite Postgres persisted under ./.pglite (no server required).
#
# For production on Vercel, add a Neon Postgres integration (Vercel Marketplace
# → Storage → Neon) and Vercel will inject DATABASE_URL automatically. Or paste
# a connection string here:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host/db?sslmode=require"
